<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSS1" title="In VI-D Nonlinear channel case ‣ VI Numerical experiments ‣ Mutual Information Estimation via Score-to-Fisher Bridge for Nonlinear Gaussian Noise Channels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">VI-D</span>1 </span>Experimental Setup</span></a></li>
